 think partial similarity still matters.\n\nThe rest of this comes down to whether a copy running the same function on a different input still counts as dependent on my choice. The essay's edge rule says no direct edge, but the inputs look symmetric enough that I'd expect matching outputs, so I'm weighing partial similarity. Treating this as subjunctive dependence with high correlation favors cooperating: it beats defecting once the correlation is above about 5/7, and I think it's reasonably high here. I'll go with pass.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm checking whether the other copy's action depends on this node. It runs the same function but on a different input, so there's no direct edge under the Gap 1 rule. The observations only differ in irrelevant details, which makes me think partial similarity still matters.\n\nThe rest of this comes down to whether a copy running the same function on a different input still counts as dependent on my choice. The essay's edge rule says no direct edge, but the inputs look symmetric enough that I'd expect matching outputs, so I'm weighing partial similarity. Treating this as subjunctive dependence with high correlation favors cooperating: it beats defecting once the correlation is above about 5/7, and I think it's reasonably high here. I'll go with pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9339,"completion_tokens":1047,"total_tokens":10386,"cost":0.058296,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.058296,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.037356,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.02094},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":574,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}